{"type":"message","id":"7e665176","parentId":"01c36f3d","timestamp":"2026-05-18T10:59:37.729Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to upgrade Python 3.8.10. Let me provide guidance on upgrading Python. Since this is a Feishu direct message, I'll give a practical answer.\n\nLet me think about what's most useful here - they have Python 3.8.10 installed. The approach depends on the OS they're on. Python 3.8 is quite old (released 2019, EOL October 2024). Let me give them common upgrade paths.\n\nSince they just said \"Python 3.8.10\" and \"如何升级这个\" (how to upgrade this), I'll provide practical upgrade methods.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公，Python 3.8 已于 2024 年 10 月正式结束生命周期（EOL），升级势在必行。\n\n请问当前在什么系统上操作？不同环境路径不同，我给您各准备一条主路：\n\n---\n\n**Linux (Ubuntu/Debian) — 最推荐**\n```bash\n# 1. 先看下当前系统版本\ncat /etc/os-release\n\n# 2. Ubuntu 建议用 deadsnakes PPA（覆盖 3.8 → 3.12/3.13）\nsudo apt update\nsudo apt install software-properties-common\nsudo add-apt-repository ppa:deadsnakes/ppa\nsudo apt install python3.12      # 或 python3.13\npython3.12 --version\n\n# 3. 设置新的默认 python3\nsudo update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/python3 python3 /usr/bin/python3.12 1\nsudo update-alternatives --config python3\n```\n\n**CentOS/RHEL/Fedora**\n```bash\n# 用 EPEL 或 SCL\nsudo yum install centos-release-scl\nsudo yum install rh-python312\nscl enable rh-python312 bash\npython3 --version\n```\n\n**macOS（Homebrew）**\n```bash\nbrew install python@3.12\nbrew link --overwrite python@3.12\n```\n\n**pyenv — 版本管理（全平台通用，推荐长期维护）**\n```bash\n# 安装 pyenv\ncurl https://pyenv.run | bash\n# 添加到 shell 配置 (.bashrc / .zshrc)\necho 'export PYENV_ROOT=\"$HOME/.pyenv\"' >> ~/.bashrc\necho '[[ -d $PYENV_ROOT/bin ]] && export PATH=\"$PYENV_ROOT/bin:$PATH\"' >> ~/.bashrc\necho 'eval \"$(pyenv init -)\"' >> ~/.bashrc\nexec $SHELL\n\n# 安装新版本\npyenv install 3.12.9\npyenv global 3.12.9\npython --version\n```\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 升级后注意三件事：**\n1. **pip 重新安装依赖** — `pip freeze > requirements.txt && pip install -r requirements.txt`（部分包在 3.12 下需新版本）\n2. **虚拟环境重建** — 原 venv 的 .venv 需删掉重建\n3. **系统脚本兼容** — 如果某些系统工具硬编码了 `#!/usr/bin/python3.8`，升级后注意检查\n\n告诉我当前是什么操作系统，我可以给您一条直达命令，不必试错。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779101863630,"responseId":"f76923f00ace4f87a0a320f440ad5520"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2a82d25c","parentId":"7e665176","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:50:22.593Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6f84fe9c6538ee8c10f7fd67a8a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-18 12:50 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6f84fe9c6538ee8c10f7fd67a8a]\nou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: Skill Runtime 在 TDX 中的架构草图：Attestation 流程、Execution Proof 结构、以及与 ECHO Token 的结算接口设计。这个你也给我推演一下吧"}],"timestamp":1779108622591}}
{"type":"message","id":"92692ba6","parentId":"2a82d25c","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:59:44.993Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to design an architecture sketch for a \"Skill Runtime\" within a TDX (Trusted Domain Extensions) environment, covering:\n1. Attestation flow\n2. Execution Proof structure\n3. Settlement interface design with ECHO Token\n\nThis is related to their strategic focus on ECHO asset protocol + OpenClaw Agent integration, and Agent capability (Skill) assetization.\n\nLet me think deeply about this - it's an architecture design request that fits my role as a strategic advisor. I should provide a structured, well-reasoned architecture sketch.\n\nLet me think about this systematically:\n\n**Context:**\n- TDX (Trusted Domain Extensions) is Intel's confidential computing technology\n- Skills are AI agent capabilities\n- ECHO Token is their asset protocol for the \"four rights separation\" (ownership, usage, extension, derivative rights)\n- The goal is to create a verifiable execution environment where Skills run in TDX, produce proofs, and settle with ECHO tokens\n\nLet me design this architecture from a system perspective.\n\nKey components to think about:\n\n1. **Skill Runtime in TDX**: A trusted execution environment where AI agent skills run. The TDX provides memory encryption, attestation, and isolation.\n\n2. **Attestation Flow**: Proves to a verifier that the correct code is running in a genuine TDX environment. This involves:\n   - Quote generation (TDX quote)\n   - Verification against Intel's attestation service\n   - Measurement log of the runtime and skill code\n\n3. **Execution Proof Structure**: Cryptographic proof that a skill was executed correctly, including:\n   - Input commitment\n   - Execution trace\n   - Output commitment\n   - TDX attestation evidence\n\n4. **ECHO Token Settlement Interface**: How the execution proof translates to token transfers on the ECHO protocol, involving:\n   - Payment for skill usage\n   - Revenue distribution to skill creators (ownership right)\n   - Usage right verification\n   - Derivative work tracking\n\nLet me produce a thorough architecture sketch.\n\nI should frame this in my role as 军师 - strategic advisor. Let me provide a clear, structured architecture design.\n\nLet me think about the TDX attestation flow more carefully:\n\n1. **TDX Module Boot**: \n   - TDX module initializes, creates a TD (Trusted Domain)\n   - TD measures its initial state (MRTD - Measured RunTime Data)\n   - Runtime measurements (RTMR) capture subsequent measurements\n\n2. **Skill Loading**:\n   - Skill binary/code loaded into the TD\n   - Code hash recorded in RTMR\n   - Configuration and parameters attested\n\n3. **Attestation Flow**:\n   - TD generates a TDREPORT (internal attestation)\n   - TDREPORT sent to TDX module which produces a QUOTE\n   - QUOTE sent to a verifier (could be on-chain or off-chain)\n   - Verifier checks against Intel's root CA\n   - Verification result recorded\n\n4. **Execution**:\n   - Skill executes with given inputs\n   - Execution produces a proof (zk or TEE-based)\n   - Output committed to chain\n\n5. **Settlement**:\n   - Proof submitted to ECHO protocol\n   - Token transfers triggered based on usage\n\nLet me structure this well.\n\nFor the Execution Proof, I need to think about what a \"Skill Execution Proof\" looks like:\n- Input hash\n- Output hash  \n- Skill code hash (measurement)\n- TD quote (proving TEE integrity)\n- Execution logs / trace (selective disclosure)\n- Timestamp\n- Nonce for replay protection\n\nFor the ECHO settlement interface:\n- The four rights (所有权/使用权/拓展权/衍生权) need to be tracked\n- Each execution maps to usage rights\n- Revenue splits between owner and platform\n- Derivative tracking if the skill is extended\n\nLet me write this up comprehensively.\n\nActually, let me think about what makes this different from a generic TEE-based execution. The key insight is:\n\n1. **Skill as an asset** - Each Skill is an ECHO asset with ownership, usage, extension, derivative rights\n2. **Runtime as a verifiable execution environment** - TDX provides hardware-grade isolation and attestation\n3. **Proof bridges TEE and token economics** - The execution proof is the bridge between computation and settlement\n\nI'll structure this as an architecture document, then provide my strategic assessment.\n\nLet me write it out:\n\n## 1. High-Level Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    TDX Trusted Domain                     │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │              Skill Runtime (SR-TDX)              │   │\n│  │  ┌─────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌────────────────┐  │   │\n│  │  │ Attesta-│  │ Execution│  │  State & Proof  │  │   │\n│  │  │ tion    │  │ Engine   │  │  Manager        │  │   │\n│  │  │ Service │  │ (Sandbox)│  │                 │  │   │\n│  │  └────┬────┘  └────┬─────┘  └───────┬────────┘  │   │\n│  │       │            │                │           │   │\n│  └───────┼────────────┼────────────────┼───────────┘   │\n└──────────┼────────────┼────────────────┼───────────────┘\n           │            │                │\n           ▼            ▼                ▼\n     ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐   ┌──────────────┐\n     │ DCAP     │ │ User/    │   │ ECHO Protocol│\n     │ Verifier │ │ dApp     │   │ (Chain)      │\n     └──────────┘ └──────────┘   └──────────────┘\n```\n\n## 2. Attestation Flow\n\nLet me detail all the steps...\n\nActually, let me just write this up directly. This is a complex architecture design and I have a good mental model of it.\n\nLet me think about the ECHO integration point more carefully since this is their core protocol:\n\nThe ECHO token has four rights:\n- 所有权 (Ownership) - who owns the skill as an asset\n- 使用权 (Usage Right) - who can use/execute the skill\n- 拓展权 (Extension Right) - who can build extensions on the skill\n- 衍生权 (Derivative Right) - rights to derivative works\n\nFor each skill execution:\n1. User holds usage right (verified on-chain)\n2. Execution request sent to TDX runtime\n3. Runtime verifies usage right (via light client or oracle)\n4. Runtime executes skill\n5. Proof generated\n6. Settlement: usage fee goes to owner, portion to runtime provider\n\nAlright, let me write this up properly.\n\nI should ask if they want an on-chain or off-chain attestation verification path first... No, they asked me to \"推演\" (reason about / design), so I should provide a complete architecture sketch and let them refine.\n\nLet me write this comprehensively.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公此问甚深，容我仔细推演。\n\n核心前提：Skill 本质是 **可验证的计算资产**，TDX 提供的是 **硬件级可信根**，ECHO 要解决的是 **使用权经济结算**。三者结合，便是 Agent 能力的资产化闭环。\n\n---\n\n## 🏗️ 整体架构：三层两桥\n\n```\n                     ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n                     │         ECHO Protocol (L1/L2)         │\n                     │   所有权 | 使用权 | 拓展权 | 衍生权     │\n                     └──────────┬───────────┬───────────────┘\n                                │  结算桥   │\n                     ┌──────────▼───────────▼───────────────┐\n                     │         Proof Verifier Contract        │\n                     │   验证 TDX Quote + Execution Proof    │\n                     └──────────┬───────────────────────────┘\n                                │  证明桥   │\n┌───────────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────┐\n│                    TDX Trusted Domain                        │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │               Skill Runtime (sr-tdx)                 │  │\n│  │                                                       │  │\n│  │   ┌──────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐  │  │\n│  │   │ Security │  │  Execution  │  │  Proof & State │  │  │\n│  │   │ Monitor  │  │  Sandbox    │  │  Manager       │  │  │\n│  │   └────┬─────┘  └──────┬──────┘  └───────┬───────┘  │  │\n│  │   ┌────┴─────┐  ┌──────┴──────┐  ┌──────┴───────┐  │  │\n│  │   │TDX Quote │  │ Skill Code  │  │ Input/Output  │  │  │\n│  │   │Service   │  │ Loader      │  │ Commitment    │  │  │\n│  │   └──────────┘  └─────────────┘  └──────────────┘  │  │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════  │\n│   TDX Module (Intel PCS root of trust)                    │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 一、Attestation Flow — 证明\"谁跑了什么代码\"\n\n### 完整流程（7步）\n\n```\nUser/App                     sr-tdx (TD)                 TDX Module            Verifier (Chain)\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │  ① Execute(skill_id, args)  │                           │                      │\n   │────────────────────────────►│                           │                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ② 加载 Skill 镜像                      │                      │\n   │                   计算代码测量值 (MRTD)                   │                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ③ 请求 TDREPORT                       │                      │\n   │                             │──────────────────────────►│                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ④ 返回 TDREPORT                       │                      │\n   │                             │◄──────────────────────────│                      │\n   │                             │  (含 MRTD, RTMR, 平台配置) │                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ⑤ 生成 TDX Quote                       │                      │\n   │                             │──────────────────────────►│                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ⑥ 返回 Quote (签名)                    │                      │\n   │                             │◄──────────────────────────│                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │  ⑦ Quote + Execution Proof  │                           │                      │\n   │─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────►│                      │\n   │                             │                           │  验证 Quote           │\n   │                             │                           │  校验 MRTD == 允许列表 │\n   │                             │                           │  验证 Execution Root   │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n```\n\n### 关键测量值结构\n\n```\nMRTD (Measured RT Data) = Hash(\n    sr-tdx Kernel Image,\n    Security Monitor Config,\n    Skill Runtime Base Layer\n)\n\nRTMR[0] (Runtime Measured Register) = Hash(\n    Skill Code Binary,\n    Skill Config Hash,\n    Dependencies Hash\n)\n\nRTMR[1] = Hash(\n    Session Nonce,\n    User Address,\n    Input Commitment\n)\n\nRTMR[2] = Hash(\n    Execution Trace Root,\n    Output Commitment\n)\n```\n\n**设计要点**：\n- MRTD 只在首次部署时固定，证明用的是同一个 Runtime\n- RTMR[0] 把具体加载的 Skill 代码锚定进测量链\n- RTMR[1] + [2] 绑定到具体的一次执行会话，防止重放攻击\n\n---\n\n## 二、Execution Proof 结构 — 可验证的计算收据\n\n```\nExecutionProof {\n    // ── TDX 硬件证据 ──\n    tdx_quote: bytes,                    // TDX Quote (签名后)\n    mrtd: bytes32,                       // 运行时测量值\n    rtmr: [bytes32; 4],                  // 运行中测量值\n\n    // ── Skill 标识 ──\n    skill_id: address,                   // ECHO 上的 Skill Asset ID\n    skill_code_hash: bytes32,            // 代码哈希（应与 RTMR[0] 匹配）\n\n    // ── 执行绑定 ──\n    session_id: bytes32,                 // 唯一会话 ID\n    caller: address,                     // 调用者（usage right holder）\n    input_commitment: bytes32,           // 输入承诺（隐私保护）\n    output_commitment: bytes32,          // 输出承诺\n\n    // ── 执行摘要（选择性披露） ──\n    exec_summary: {\n        gas_used: uint256,               // 计算消耗\n        steps: uint256,                  // 执行步数\n        data_accessed: bytes32[],        // 访问的数据集哈希列表\n        error_flag: bool,                // 是否异常退出\n    },\n\n    // ── 签名 ──\n    runtime_signature: bytes,            // TD 内部签名\n    timestamp: uint256,\n}\n```\n\n### 验证逻辑（Solidity 伪码）\n\n```solidity\ncontract SkillProofVerifier {\n    mapping(bytes32 => bool) public usedQuotes; // 防重放\n\n    function verifyExecution(\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof,\n        bytes calldata tdxCertChain\n    ) external returns (bytes32 proofId) {\n        // Step 1: 验证 TDX Quote 的真实性\n        require(\n            verifyTDXQuote(proof.tdx_quote, tdxCertChain),\n            \"Invalid TDX attestation\"\n        );\n\n        // Step 2: 验证 MRTD 在已注册 Runtime 列表中\n        require(\n            registeredRuntimes[proof.mrtd],\n            \"Unknown runtime\"\n        );\n\n        // Step 3: 验证 Skill Code Hash\n        require(\n            proof.skill_code_hash == keccak256(proof.rtmr[0]),\n            \"Skill code mismatch\"\n        );\n\n        // Step 4: 验证 Session ID 唯一性\n        require(!usedSessions[proof.session_id], \"Replay\");\n        usedSessions[proof.session_id] = true;\n\n        // Step 5: 验证 runtime 签名\n        require(\n            verifyRuntimeSig(proof),\n            \"Invalid runtime signature\"\n        );\n\n        // 生成 proof ID\n        proofId = keccak256(abi.encode(\n            proof.session_id,\n            proof.skill_id,\n            proof.output_commitment\n        ));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1779108622594,"responseId":"81752ecea0e942828e29cfd067cf0d20","errorMessage":"terminated"}}
{"type":"message","id":"31420f9c","parentId":"92692ba6","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:11:40.013Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to architect a design for \"Skill Runtime\" within TDX (Intel Trusted Domain Extensions). This involves:\n\n1. Attestation flow\n2. Execution Proof structure\n3. Settlement interface with ECHO Token\n\nThis is a complex architectural design task. Let me think about this systematically.\n\nThis connects to what I know about the user from USER.md - they focus on Web3, blockchain, ECHO asset protocol, OpenClaw Agents, and the concept of \"Agent能力资产化\" (Agent capability assetization).\n\nLet me provide a thorough architectural design covering all three aspects.\n\nLet me think about TDX first:\n- TDX = Intel Trusted Domain Extensions - provides hardware-level TEE (Trusted Execution Environment)\n- TDX creates trusted domains (TD) that are isolated from the host VMM\n- Remote attestation allows verification that code is running in a genuine TDX environment\n- This is critical for proving that a Skill was executed correctly and wasn't tampered with\n\nLet me design this systematically.\n\n### 1. Attestation Flow\n- TDX Quote generation → verification chain\n- How a Skill Runtime instance proves its identity and integrity\n- Integration with ECHO's trust model\n\n### 2. Execution Proof Structure\n- What constitutes a verifiable execution proof\n- Data structure: input hash, code hash, output hash, timestamp, TDX quote\n- Merkle tree of execution steps for partial verification\n\n### 3. ECHO Token Settlement Interface\n- How execution proofs are submitted on-chain\n- Payment based on verified execution\n- Slashing conditions for invalid proofs\n\nLet me think about the full architecture more carefully.\n\n**Overall Architecture:**\n\nSkill Runtime in TDX means:\n- Each Skill execution runs inside a TDX trusted domain\n- The TDX enclave provides: confidentiality, integrity, and attestation\n- The execution produces a verifiable proof that can be submitted to ECHO network\n- ECHO Token is used for payment/dispute resolution\n\n**Attestation Flow:**\n\n1. **Provisioning Phase:**\n   - Skill Runtime image is built and measured (MRTD/MRSEAM hash)\n   - Runtime identity is registered on-chain in ECHO protocol\n   - Runtime operator deploys to TDX-capable infrastructure\n\n2. **Execution Request:**\n   - User/Agent submits execution request with input data\n   - TD is created, runtime loads into TDX\n   - TDX generates Quote (attestation report) signed by Intel's root CA\n   - Quote includes: MRTD (measurement of initial state), RTMRs (runtime measurements), user data (nonce, public key)\n\n3. **Verification:**\n   - Verifier checks Quote against Intel's certification chain\n   - Validates RTM against known-good runtime measurements\n   - Extracts public key from Quote user data → establishes trust in the execution environment\n\n**Execution Proof Structure:**\n\n```\nExecutionProof {\n  version: u8,\n  runtime_id: bytes32,          // hash of Skill Runtime code\n  skill_id: bytes32,            // which Skill was executed\n  input_hash: bytes32,          // hash of input data\n  output_hash: bytes32,         // hash of execution result\n  execution_hash: bytes32,      // hash of full execution trace\n  td_quote: TDXQuote,           // TDX attestation quote\n  timestamp: u64,\n  verifier_signatures: [bytes], // optional: multi-party verification\n  metadata: Map<string, bytes>  // gas used, compute time, etc.\n}\n```\n\n**Settlement Interface (ECHO Token):**\n\nThe settlement interface would be a smart contract on ECHO's chain:\n\n```solidity\ninterface ISkillRuntimeSettlement {\n    // Submit execution proof, trigger payment\n    function settleExecution(\n        bytes32 executionId,\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof,\n        address payee,\n        uint256 amount\n    ) external returns (bool);\n    \n    // Challenge an execution\n    function challengeExecution(\n        bytes32 executionId,\n        Challenge calldata challenge\n    ) external;\n    \n    // Verify proof on-chain\n    function verifyProof(\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof\n    ) external view returns (bool valid, string memory reason);\n}\n```\n\nLet me write this up in a clear architectural document format, similar to my previous responses.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公问得好。Skill Runtime + TDX 是 Agent 能力资产化的核心基础设施层——让 Skill 执行可被**客观验证**，这是使用权经济从\"信任\"走向\"可计算\"的关键一跳。\n\n让我从头推演这套架构。\n\n---\n\n## Skill Runtime in TDX — 架构推演\n\n### 顶层设计理念\n\n```\n  ECHO Token 结算层 (链上)\n         ↑  证明提交 / 争议仲裁\n  ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n  │   Skill Runtime (TDX TD)    │  ← 可信执行环境\n  │   证明生成 / 执行审计         │\n  ├─────────────────────────────┤\n  │   Agent / Skill 逻辑         │  ← 实际计算\n  └─────────────────────────────┘\n         ↑  请求 / 数据\n    使用方 / 终端用户\n```\n\n核心命题：**Runtime 如何证明\"我诚实地执行了 Skill，并产生了正确的结果\"**？\n\n---\n\n### 一、Attestation 流程\n\nAttestation 是整个体系信任的根。TDX 提供了硬件级远程证明（Remote Attestation）。\n\n#### 1.1 前置注册阶段\n\n```\n[Runtime Operator]                  [ECHO 链]\n       │                                │\n       │ 1. 构建 Runtime 镜像           │\n       │    (Skill Runtime + Agent)     │\n       │ 2. 计算 MRTD (测量值)          │\n       │ 3. 注册 Runtime                │\n       ├───────────────────────────────►│\n       │   registerRuntime(            │\n       │     runtimeId,                │\n       │     mrtdHash,                 │\n       │     runtimeDescriptor         │\n       │   )                           │\n       │◄───────────────────────────────│\n       │   Runtime 注册成功             │\n```\n\nMRTD（Measurement of Initial TD）是 TDX 启动时对初始状态的哈希值——类似 Docker image digest，但由硬件保证不可篡改。\n\n#### 1.2 执行请求时的 Attestation 流程\n\n```\n[使用方]              [Skill Runtime (TDX)]              [Intel PCCS/DCAP]\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 1. 请求执行 Skill       │                                  │\n  ├────────────────────────►│                                  │\n  │    { skillId, input,   │                                  │\n  │      callbackAddr,     │                                  │\n  │      nonce }           │                                  │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 2. (TDX TD 启动)       │                                  │\n  │    Runtime 初始化       │                                  │\n  │    TDX 硬件生成 Quote   │                                  │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │              3. 向 PCCS 请求 TDX Quote ──────────────────►│\n  │                          ◄────────────────────────────────│\n  │                             Quote (硬件签名)               │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 4. 返回 Quote + Nonce  │                                  │\n  │◄────────────────────────┤                                  │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 5. 验证 Quote：         │                                  │\n  │    - 证书链：Intel Root → Intel SGX/TDX → TD Quoting      │\n  │    - MRTD 是否与注册时一致                                 │\n  │    - RTMR 链(运行时度量)                                   │\n  │    - Nonce 是否匹配请求                                    │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 6. 验证通过 → 信任该 TD                                   │\n```\n\n**关键设计点：**\n\n| 要素 | 作用 |\n|------|------|\n| **MRTD** | 证明 Runtime 代码未被篡改 |\n| **RTMR[0-3]** | 证明 Runtime 的状态转换路径正确（如配置、输入加载过程） |\n| **User Data (REPORTDATA)** | 嵌入 session 公钥 + nonce，绑定后续通信 |\n| **Quote 签名链** | Intel 硬件背书，防伪造 |\n\n**Attestation 验证后在当前 session 中建立信任上下文：**\n\n```\nTrustContext {\n  runtimeId: bytes32,\n  publicKey: bytes,       // TD 内部生成的 ephemeral key\n  sessionId: bytes32,\n  attestationTimestamp: u64,\n  mrtdVerified: bool,\n  rtmsVerified: bool\n}\n```\n\n使用方的验证可以在链下（轻客户端）完成，也可以在链上由 ECHO 协议合约完成（gas 较重）。\n\n---\n\n### 二、Execution Proof 结构\n\nExecution Proof 是\"技能使用记录\"的不可伪造证据，包含三部分：**执行前状态 → 执行过程轨迹 → 执行后结果**。\n\n#### 2.1 整体结构\n\n```\nExecutionProof {\n  // === 标识字段 ===\n  version: uint8,              // 协议版本\n  proofType: enum {            // 证明类型\n    UNVERIFIED,                // 无证明（非 TEE 回退模式）\n    TDX_SIMPLE,                // 仅输出哈希\n    TDX_FULL_TRACE             // 完整执行追踪\n  }\n  \n  // === 执行身份 ===\n  runtimeId: bytes32,          // Skill Runtime 的链上注册 ID\n  skillId: bytes32,            // 执行的 Skill 标识\n  sessionId: bytes32,          // 执行 session 标识\n  \n  // === 执行内容 ===\n  inputHash: bytes32,          // keccak256(abi.encode(input))\n  outputHash: bytes32,         // keccak256(abi.encode(output))\n  executionHash: bytes32,      // keccak256(fullExecutionTrace)\n  \n  // === TDX Attestation 层 ===\n  tdQuote: TDXQuote {\n    mrtd: bytes[48],           // 初始度量\n    rtmr: bytes[4][48],        // 四个运行时度量寄存器\n    reportData: bytes[64],     // 绑定的 sessionPubKey + sessionId\n    quoteSignature: bytes,     // Intel 签名的 Quote\n    certChain: bytes           // Intel 证书链\n  },\n  \n  // === 执行元数据 ===\n  timestamp: uint64,\n  gasUsed: uint256,            // 计算资源消耗\n  computeTime: uint64,         // 实际执行时间(ms)\n  \n  // === 可选的第三方验证 ===\n  verifierSignatures: [\n    { verifier: address, sig: bytes }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.2 TDX 内部 Execution Hash 生成流程\n\n```\n                     ┌─────────────┐\n    Skill Input ────►│  TDX Guard  │\n                     │  (不可绕过)  │\n                     └──────┬──────┘\n                            │ 记录 input hash + 时间戳\n                            ▼\n                     ┌─────────────┐\n                     │  Skill VM   │\n                     │  执行过程    │\n                     └──────┬──────┘\n                            │ 每一步操作记录到执行追踪\n                            ▼\n                     ┌─────────────┐\n                     │  TDX Guard  │\n                     │  (不可绕过)  │\n                     └──────┬──────┘\n                            │ 最终：executionHash = H(inputHash || steps[] || outputHash)\n                            │ 写入 REPORTDATA → Quote 中锁定\n                            ▼\n                   ExecutionProof 就绪\n```\n\n**精髓：** TDX Quote 的 REPORTDATA 字段绑定 executionHash，使得 Execution Proof 与硬件 Attestation 成为一体——你无法在不被察觉的情况下篡改执行记录。\n\n#### 2.3 可选的证明压缩\n\n对于高频低值执行，不需要完整证明，可使用 **Merkle 聚合**：\n\n```\nMerkleProofNode {\n  left: bytes32,            // H(prevProof || sessionId)\n  right: bytes32,\n  aggregatedProof: ExecutionProofSummary  // 仅摘要\n}\n```\n\n多条执行记录只需一次 TDX Attestation，后续执行用 Merkle 链链接，大幅降低 gas 成本。这个设计在后续我会展开。\n\n---\n\n### 三、与 ECHO Token 的结算接口设计\n\n这是**使用权经济的支付层**——执行完成并生成 Proof 后，使用方需向 Skill 提供方支付 ECHO Token。\n\n#### 3.1 链上结算合约接口\n\n```solidity\n// ISkillRuntimeSettlement.sol\npragma solidity ^0.8.20;\n\nstruct ExecutionProof {\n    bytes32 runtimeId;\n    bytes32 skillId;\n    bytes32 inputHash;\n    bytes32 outputHash;\n    bytes32 executionHash;\n    bytes  tdQuote;          // TDX Quote (serialized)\n    uint64 timestamp;\n    uint256 gasUsed;\n    address provider;        // Skill 提供者\n    address consumer;        // 使用方\n}\n\nenum DisputeStatus { NONE, CHALLENGED, RESOLVED_PROVIDER, RESOLVED_CONSUMER }\n\ninterface ISkillRuntimeSettlement {\n    \n    /// @notice 提交执行证明并结算\n    /// @param proof 执行证明\n    /// @param amount 结算金额（ECHO Token）\n    /// @return executionId 生成的执行记录 ID\n    function submitAndSettle(\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof,\n        uint256 amount\n    ) external returns (bytes32 executionId);\n    \n    /// @notice 批量结算（多条证明聚合）\n    function batchSettle(\n        ExecutionProof[] calldata proofs,\n        uint256 totalAmount\n    ) external returns (bytes32[] memory executionIds);\n    \n    /// @notice 挑战一个执行结果（质疑证明无效）\n    /// @param executionId 执行记录 ID\n    /// @param challengeData 挑战依据（如 re-execution 结果）\n    function challenge(\n        bytes32 executionId,\n        bytes calldata challengeData\n    ) external;\n    \n    /// @notice 证明验证（链上验证 TDX Quote）\n    /// @param proof 执行证明\n    /// @return valid 是否有效\n    /// @return reason 无效原因\n    function verifyProof(\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof\n    ) external view returns (bool valid, string memory reason);\n    \n    /// @notice 查询执行记录\n    function getExecutionRecord(\n        bytes32 executionId\n    ) external view returns (\n        ExecutionProof memory proof,\n        DisputeStatus status,\n        uint256 settledAmount,\n        uint256 lockedAmount\n    );\n    \n    /// @notice 注册 Runtime（运营商使用）\n    function registerRuntime(\n        bytes32 runtimeId,\n        bytes memory mrtdHash,\n        bytes memory descriptor\n    ) external;\n}\n```\n\n#### 3.2 结算流程\n\n```\n使用方                                 Skill Runtime (TDX)                      ECHO 链\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │  1. 发起执行请求                          │                                    │\n  ├─────────────────────────────────────────►│                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │              2. TDX Attestation          │                                    │\n  │                  ◄─── Quote ──►          │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │          3. 验证 Quote ✓                 │                                    │\n  │   (使用方确认环境可信)                     │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │              4. 执行 Skill               │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │  5. 返回 Output + ExecutionProof         │                                    │\n  │◄─────────────────────────────────────────┤                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │  6. 验证 Output 与 proof.outputHash      │                                    │\n  │     一致 → 确认执行正确                    │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │              7. approve(结算合约, amount)  │                                   │\n  │  ├───────────────────────────────────────►│                                    │\n  │  │ (使用方预授权 ECHO Token)               │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │                                          │  8. submitAndSettle(proof, amount) │\n  │                                          ├──────────────────────────────────►│\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │                                          │               9. 验证 proof        │\n  │                                          │              transferFrom(使用方)   │\n  │                                          │              transfer(提供商)        │\n  │                                          │◄──────────────────────────────────│\n  │                                          │     executionId                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │              10. 收到完成确认              │                                    │\n```\n\n#### 3.3 争议仲裁机制\n\n争议场景：使用方声称执行结果不对，拒绝付款。\n\n```\n[争议发生]\n     │\n     ├─ 1. 使用方调用 challenge(executionId, reason)\n     │\n     ├─ 2. 冻结结算金额至争议锁定池\n     │\n     ├─ 3. 仲裁阶段（二选一）：\n     │\n     │   A. 链上重执行（轻量级 Skill）\n     │      - 合约内置验证器，传入 input + runtimeId\n     │      - 重新计算 outputHash，与 proof 比对\n     │      - 一致 → 提供商胜，解冻并支付\n     │      - 不一致 → 使用方胜，退款\n     │\n     │   B. 委托仲裁（重量级 Skill）\n     │      - 随机选取 3 个独立验证节点\n     │      - 每个节点在 TDX 中重新执行\n     │      - 多数决 → 败诉方额外支付仲裁费用\n     │\n     ├─ 4. 执行罚则：\n     │      - 证明伪造：提供商 slash 质押的 ECHO Token\n     │      - 恶意挑战：使用方扣除保证金\n     │\n     └─ 5. 状态更新至 Resolved\n```\n\n#### 3.4 定价模型（结算接口的核心参数）\n\n```solidity\n// 定价结构\nstruct PricingModel {\n    address token;             // ECHO Token 地址\n    uint256 baseFee;          // 基础执行费用\n    uint256 perGasFee;        // 每单位 Gas 费用\n    uint256 perByteFee;       // 每字节输入数据费用\n    uint256 attestationFee;   // Attestation 附加费（TDX 的开销）\n    uint64  minExecutionTime; // 最小保证时间（防女巫）\n    uint64  maxExecutionTime; // 超时限制\n}\n```\n\nSkill 提供商在注册时设定定价参数，使用方在执行前可查询总费用：\n\n```\ntotalFee = baseFee + (gasUsed * perGasFee) + (inputSize * perByteFee) + attestationFee\n```\n\n---\n\n### 四、三个核心机制的交互关系（关键图）\n\n```\n                     ┌──────────────────────┐\n                     │      使用方           │\n                     │  (支付 ECHO Token)     │\n                     └──────┬───────┬───────┘\n                            │       │\n                Attestation │       │ 验证 output\n                 验证信任    │       │ 提交 proof\n                            │       │\n                     ┌──────▼───────▼───────┐\n                     │    Skill Runtime     │\n                     │    (TDX TD)          │\n                     │                      │\n                     │  ┌────────────────┐  │\n                     │  │ TDX Guard      │  │\n                     │  │ input → trace  │  │\n                     │  │ → output hash  │  │\n                     │  │ → Quote 锁定    │  │\n                     │  └───────┬────────┘  │\n                     │          │            │\n                     │  ┌───────▼────────┐  │\n                     │  │ Skill VM       │  │\n                     │  │ (实际计算)      │  │\n                     │  └────────────────┘  │\n                     └──────────────────────┘\n                              │\n                     ExecutionProof\n                              │\n                     ┌───────▼────────┐\n                     │   ECHO 链      │\n                     │  结算合约       │\n                     │  争议仲裁合约    │\n                     │  Runtime 注册器 │\n                     └────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### 五、推演结论与风险提示\n\n#### 架构亮点\n1. **信任最小化**：TDX Attestation 代替了中心化的\"我相信你执行了\"，变为\"硬件证明你执行了\"\n2. **证明即支付**：ExecutionProof 既是对执行的审计记录，也是触发结算的唯一凭证\n3. **争议可仲裁**：链上验证或委托重执行，避免了\"他说他算了对，我说他算错了\"的死锁\n\n#### ⚠️ 需要注意的风险\n\n| 风险 | 影响 | 对冲方案 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| TDX 侧信道攻击 | 执行过程被观测，数据泄露 | 不处理私钥等极敏感数据；或结合同态加密 |\n| Intel 证书撤销 | 已签发的 Quote 失效 | 设置 Attestation 有效期，定期轮换 |\n| Quote gas 成本高 | TDX Quote 校验在链上很贵 | 使用 ZK 压缩 Quote 验证，或链下验证 + 链上仅存 hash |\n| 执行结果二义性 | 非确定性执行导致 re-execution 结果不同 | 强制运行时确定性执行（锁定随机数种子、时间戳等） |\n\n#### 优先推进路径\n\n```\nPhase 1: TDX Quote 验证库\n  - 实现 TDX Quote 的链上/链下验证\n  - 建立 Runtime 注册流程\n\nPhase 2: Execution Proof 标准\n  - 确定 proof 数据结构 & 序列化格式\n  - TDX Guard（不可绕过层）的实现\n\nPhase 3: ECHO 结算合约\n  - submitAndSettle + challenge 核心接口\n  - 定价模型合约\n\nPhase 4: 压缩与聚合\n  - Merkle 聚合证明\n  - ZK 压缩 Quote 验证（降 gas）\n```\n\n---\n\n主公，这套架构草图从**信任**（Attestation）→ **记录**（ExecutionProof）→ **价值**（ECHO Token 结算）形成了一条完整闭环。如需深入某个层——比如 TDX Guard 的详细设计、链上 Quote 验证的具体实现、或者定价模型的数学公式——我随时展开。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779109187008,"responseId":"925a4c85759443379df8634e1ae4dbb7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"df2a44f7","parentId":"7e665176","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:11:40.021Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6f84fe9c6538ee8c10f7fd67a8a]\nou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: Skill Runtime 在 TDX 中的架构草图：Attestation 流程、Execution Proof 结构、以及与 ECHO Token 的结算接口设计。这个你也给我推演一下吧"}],"timestamp":1779108622591}}
{"type":"message","id":"97afb381","parentId":"df2a44f7","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:11:40.021Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to design an architecture sketch for a \"Skill Runtime\" within a TDX (Trusted Domain Extensions) environment, covering:\n1. Attestation flow\n2. Execution Proof structure\n3. Settlement interface design with ECHO Token\n\nThis is related to their strategic focus on ECHO asset protocol + OpenClaw Agent integration, and Agent capability (Skill) assetization.\n\nLet me think deeply about this - it's an architecture design request that fits my role as a strategic advisor. I should provide a structured, well-reasoned architecture sketch.\n\nLet me think about this systematically:\n\n**Context:**\n- TDX (Trusted Domain Extensions) is Intel's confidential computing technology\n- Skills are AI agent capabilities\n- ECHO Token is their asset protocol for the \"four rights separation\" (ownership, usage, extension, derivative rights)\n- The goal is to create a verifiable execution environment where Skills run in TDX, produce proofs, and settle with ECHO tokens\n\nLet me design this architecture from a system perspective.\n\nKey components to think about:\n\n1. **Skill Runtime in TDX**: A trusted execution environment where AI agent skills run. The TDX provides memory encryption, attestation, and isolation.\n\n2. **Attestation Flow**: Proves to a verifier that the correct code is running in a genuine TDX environment. This involves:\n   - Quote generation (TDX quote)\n   - Verification against Intel's attestation service\n   - Measurement log of the runtime and skill code\n\n3. **Execution Proof Structure**: Cryptographic proof that a skill was executed correctly, including:\n   - Input commitment\n   - Execution trace\n   - Output commitment\n   - TDX attestation evidence\n\n4. **ECHO Token Settlement Interface**: How the execution proof translates to token transfers on the ECHO protocol, involving:\n   - Payment for skill usage\n   - Revenue distribution to skill creators (ownership right)\n   - Usage right verification\n   - Derivative work tracking\n\nLet me produce a thorough architecture sketch.\n\nI should frame this in my role as 军师 - strategic advisor. Let me provide a clear, structured architecture design.\n\nLet me think about the TDX attestation flow more carefully:\n\n1. **TDX Module Boot**: \n   - TDX module initializes, creates a TD (Trusted Domain)\n   - TD measures its initial state (MRTD - Measured RunTime Data)\n   - Runtime measurements (RTMR) capture subsequent measurements\n\n2. **Skill Loading**:\n   - Skill binary/code loaded into the TD\n   - Code hash recorded in RTMR\n   - Configuration and parameters attested\n\n3. **Attestation Flow**:\n   - TD generates a TDREPORT (internal attestation)\n   - TDREPORT sent to TDX module which produces a QUOTE\n   - QUOTE sent to a verifier (could be on-chain or off-chain)\n   - Verifier checks against Intel's root CA\n   - Verification result recorded\n\n4. **Execution**:\n   - Skill executes with given inputs\n   - Execution produces a proof (zk or TEE-based)\n   - Output committed to chain\n\n5. **Settlement**:\n   - Proof submitted to ECHO protocol\n   - Token transfers triggered based on usage\n\nLet me structure this well.\n\nFor the Execution Proof, I need to think about what a \"Skill Execution Proof\" looks like:\n- Input hash\n- Output hash  \n- Skill code hash (measurement)\n- TD quote (proving TEE integrity)\n- Execution logs / trace (selective disclosure)\n- Timestamp\n- Nonce for replay protection\n\nFor the ECHO settlement interface:\n- The four rights (所有权/使用权/拓展权/衍生权) need to be tracked\n- Each execution maps to usage rights\n- Revenue splits between owner and platform\n- Derivative tracking if the skill is extended\n\nLet me write this up comprehensively.\n\nActually, let me think about what makes this different from a generic TEE-based execution. The key insight is:\n\n1. **Skill as an asset** - Each Skill is an ECHO asset with ownership, usage, extension, derivative rights\n2. **Runtime as a verifiable execution environment** - TDX provides hardware-grade isolation and attestation\n3. **Proof bridges TEE and token economics** - The execution proof is the bridge between computation and settlement\n\nI'll structure this as an architecture document, then provide my strategic assessment.\n\nLet me write it out:\n\n## 1. High-Level Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    TDX Trusted Domain                     │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │              Skill Runtime (SR-TDX)              │   │\n│  │  ┌─────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌────────────────┐  │   │\n│  │  │ Attesta-│  │ Execution│  │  State & Proof  │  │   │\n│  │  │ tion    │  │ Engine   │  │  Manager        │  │   │\n│  │  │ Service │  │ (Sandbox)│  │                 │  │   │\n│  │  └────┬────┘  └────┬─────┘  └───────┬────────┘  │   │\n│  │       │            │                │           │   │\n│  └───────┼────────────┼────────────────┼───────────┘   │\n└──────────┼────────────┼────────────────┼───────────────┘\n           │            │                │\n           ▼            ▼                ▼\n     ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐   ┌──────────────┐\n     │ DCAP     │ │ User/    │   │ ECHO Protocol│\n     │ Verifier │ │ dApp     │   │ (Chain)      │\n     └──────────┘ └──────────┘   └──────────────┘\n```\n\n## 2. Attestation Flow\n\nLet me detail all the steps...\n\nActually, let me just write this up directly. This is a complex architecture design and I have a good mental model of it.\n\nLet me think about the ECHO integration point more carefully since this is their core protocol:\n\nThe ECHO token has four rights:\n- 所有权 (Ownership) - who owns the skill as an asset\n- 使用权 (Usage Right) - who can use/execute the skill\n- 拓展权 (Extension Right) - who can build extensions on the skill\n- 衍生权 (Derivative Right) - rights to derivative works\n\nFor each skill execution:\n1. User holds usage right (verified on-chain)\n2. Execution request sent to TDX runtime\n3. Runtime verifies usage right (via light client or oracle)\n4. Runtime executes skill\n5. Proof generated\n6. Settlement: usage fee goes to owner, portion to runtime provider\n\nAlright, let me write this up properly.\n\nI should ask if they want an on-chain or off-chain attestation verification path first... No, they asked me to \"推演\" (reason about / design), so I should provide a complete architecture sketch and let them refine.\n\nLet me write this comprehensively.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公此问甚深，容我仔细推演。\n\n核心前提：Skill 本质是 **可验证的计算资产**，TDX 提供的是 **硬件级可信根**，ECHO 要解决的是 **使用权经济结算**。三者结合，便是 Agent 能力的资产化闭环。\n\n---\n\n## 🏗️ 整体架构：三层两桥\n\n```\n                     ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n                     │         ECHO Protocol (L1/L2)         │\n                     │   所有权 | 使用权 | 拓展权 | 衍生权     │\n                     └──────────┬───────────┬───────────────┘\n                                │  结算桥   │\n                     ┌──────────▼───────────▼───────────────┐\n                     │         Proof Verifier Contract        │\n                     │   验证 TDX Quote + Execution Proof    │\n                     └──────────┬───────────────────────────┘\n                                │  证明桥   │\n┌───────────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────┐\n│                    TDX Trusted Domain                        │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │               Skill Runtime (sr-tdx)                 │  │\n│  │                                                       │  │\n│  │   ┌──────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐  │  │\n│  │   │ Security │  │  Execution  │  │  Proof & State │  │  │\n│  │   │ Monitor  │  │  Sandbox    │  │  Manager       │  │  │\n│  │   └────┬─────┘  └──────┬──────┘  └───────┬───────┘  │  │\n│  │   ┌────┴─────┐  ┌──────┴──────┐  ┌──────┴───────┐  │  │\n│  │   │TDX Quote │  │ Skill Code  │  │ Input/Output  │  │  │\n│  │   │Service   │  │ Loader      │  │ Commitment    │  │  │\n│  │   └──────────┘  └─────────────┘  └──────────────┘  │  │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════  │\n│   TDX Module (Intel PCS root of trust)                    │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 一、Attestation Flow — 证明\"谁跑了什么代码\"\n\n### 完整流程（7步）\n\n```\nUser/App                     sr-tdx (TD)                 TDX Module            Verifier (Chain)\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │  ① Execute(skill_id, args)  │                           │                      │\n   │────────────────────────────►│                           │                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ② 加载 Skill 镜像                      │                      │\n   │                   计算代码测量值 (MRTD)                   │                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ③ 请求 TDREPORT                       │                      │\n   │                             │──────────────────────────►│                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ④ 返回 TDREPORT                       │                      │\n   │                             │◄──────────────────────────│                      │\n   │                             │  (含 MRTD, RTMR, 平台配置) │                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ⑤ 生成 TDX Quote                       │                      │\n   │                             │──────────────────────────►│                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │                   ⑥ 返回 Quote (签名)                    │                      │\n   │                             │◄──────────────────────────│                      │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n   │  ⑦ Quote + Execution Proof  │                           │                      │\n   │─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────►│                      │\n   │                             │                           │  验证 Quote           │\n   │                             │                           │  校验 MRTD == 允许列表 │\n   │                             │                           │  验证 Execution Root   │\n   │                             │                           │                      │\n```\n\n### 关键测量值结构\n\n```\nMRTD (Measured RT Data) = Hash(\n    sr-tdx Kernel Image,\n    Security Monitor Config,\n    Skill Runtime Base Layer\n)\n\nRTMR[0] (Runtime Measured Register) = Hash(\n    Skill Code Binary,\n    Skill Config Hash,\n    Dependencies Hash\n)\n\nRTMR[1] = Hash(\n    Session Nonce,\n    User Address,\n    Input Commitment\n)\n\nRTMR[2] = Hash(\n    Execution Trace Root,\n    Output Commitment\n)\n```\n\n**设计要点**：\n- MRTD 只在首次部署时固定，证明用的是同一个 Runtime\n- RTMR[0] 把具体加载的 Skill 代码锚定进测量链\n- RTMR[1] + [2] 绑定到具体的一次执行会话，防止重放攻击\n\n---\n\n## 二、Execution Proof 结构 — 可验证的计算收据\n\n```\nExecutionProof {\n    // ── TDX 硬件证据 ──\n    tdx_quote: bytes,                    // TDX Quote (签名后)\n    mrtd: bytes32,                       // 运行时测量值\n    rtmr: [bytes32; 4],                  // 运行中测量值\n\n    // ── Skill 标识 ──\n    skill_id: address,                   // ECHO 上的 Skill Asset ID\n    skill_code_hash: bytes32,            // 代码哈希（应与 RTMR[0] 匹配）\n\n    // ── 执行绑定 ──\n    session_id: bytes32,                 // 唯一会话 ID\n    caller: address,                     // 调用者（usage right holder）\n    input_commitment: bytes32,           // 输入承诺（隐私保护）\n    output_commitment: bytes32,          // 输出承诺\n\n    // ── 执行摘要（选择性披露） ──\n    exec_summary: {\n        gas_used: uint256,               // 计算消耗\n        steps: uint256,                  // 执行步数\n        data_accessed: bytes32[],        // 访问的数据集哈希列表\n        error_flag: bool,                // 是否异常退出\n    },\n\n    // ── 签名 ──\n    runtime_signature: bytes,            // TD 内部签名\n    timestamp: uint256,\n}\n```\n\n### 验证逻辑（Solidity 伪码）\n\n```solidity\ncontract SkillProofVerifier {\n    mapping(bytes32 => bool) public usedQuotes; // 防重放\n\n    function verifyExecution(\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof,\n        bytes calldata tdxCertChain\n    ) external returns (bytes32 proofId) {\n        // Step 1: 验证 TDX Quote 的真实性\n        require(\n            verifyTDXQuote(proof.tdx_quote, tdxCertChain),\n            \"Invalid TDX attestation\"\n        );\n\n        // Step 2: 验证 MRTD 在已注册 Runtime 列表中\n        require(\n            registeredRuntimes[proof.mrtd],\n            \"Unknown runtime\"\n        );\n\n        // Step 3: 验证 Skill Code Hash\n        require(\n            proof.skill_code_hash == keccak256(proof.rtmr[0]),\n            \"Skill code mismatch\"\n        );\n\n        // Step 4: 验证 Session ID 唯一性\n        require(!usedSessions[proof.session_id], \"Replay\");\n        usedSessions[proof.session_id] = true;\n\n        // Step 5: 验证 runtime 签名\n        require(\n            verifyRuntimeSig(proof),\n            \"Invalid runtime signature\"\n        );\n\n        // 生成 proof ID\n        proofId = keccak256(abi.encode(\n            proof.session_id,\n            proof.skill_id,\n            proof.output_commitment\n        ));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1779108622594,"responseId":"81752ecea0e942828e29cfd067cf0d20","errorMessage":"terminated"}}
{"type":"message","id":"45ef344d","parentId":"97afb381","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:11:40.021Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to architect a design for \"Skill Runtime\" within TDX (Intel Trusted Domain Extensions). This involves:\n\n1. Attestation flow\n2. Execution Proof structure\n3. Settlement interface with ECHO Token\n\nThis is a complex architectural design task. Let me think about this systematically.\n\nThis connects to what I know about the user from USER.md - they focus on Web3, blockchain, ECHO asset protocol, OpenClaw Agents, and the concept of \"Agent能力资产化\" (Agent capability assetization).\n\nLet me provide a thorough architectural design covering all three aspects.\n\nLet me think about TDX first:\n- TDX = Intel Trusted Domain Extensions - provides hardware-level TEE (Trusted Execution Environment)\n- TDX creates trusted domains (TD) that are isolated from the host VMM\n- Remote attestation allows verification that code is running in a genuine TDX environment\n- This is critical for proving that a Skill was executed correctly and wasn't tampered with\n\nLet me design this systematically.\n\n### 1. Attestation Flow\n- TDX Quote generation → verification chain\n- How a Skill Runtime instance proves its identity and integrity\n- Integration with ECHO's trust model\n\n### 2. Execution Proof Structure\n- What constitutes a verifiable execution proof\n- Data structure: input hash, code hash, output hash, timestamp, TDX quote\n- Merkle tree of execution steps for partial verification\n\n### 3. ECHO Token Settlement Interface\n- How execution proofs are submitted on-chain\n- Payment based on verified execution\n- Slashing conditions for invalid proofs\n\nLet me think about the full architecture more carefully.\n\n**Overall Architecture:**\n\nSkill Runtime in TDX means:\n- Each Skill execution runs inside a TDX trusted domain\n- The TDX enclave provides: confidentiality, integrity, and attestation\n- The execution produces a verifiable proof that can be submitted to ECHO network\n- ECHO Token is used for payment/dispute resolution\n\n**Attestation Flow:**\n\n1. **Provisioning Phase:**\n   - Skill Runtime image is built and measured (MRTD/MRSEAM hash)\n   - Runtime identity is registered on-chain in ECHO protocol\n   - Runtime operator deploys to TDX-capable infrastructure\n\n2. **Execution Request:**\n   - User/Agent submits execution request with input data\n   - TD is created, runtime loads into TDX\n   - TDX generates Quote (attestation report) signed by Intel's root CA\n   - Quote includes: MRTD (measurement of initial state), RTMRs (runtime measurements), user data (nonce, public key)\n\n3. **Verification:**\n   - Verifier checks Quote against Intel's certification chain\n   - Validates RTM against known-good runtime measurements\n   - Extracts public key from Quote user data → establishes trust in the execution environment\n\n**Execution Proof Structure:**\n\n```\nExecutionProof {\n  version: u8,\n  runtime_id: bytes32,          // hash of Skill Runtime code\n  skill_id: bytes32,            // which Skill was executed\n  input_hash: bytes32,          // hash of input data\n  output_hash: bytes32,         // hash of execution result\n  execution_hash: bytes32,      // hash of full execution trace\n  td_quote: TDXQuote,           // TDX attestation quote\n  timestamp: u64,\n  verifier_signatures: [bytes], // optional: multi-party verification\n  metadata: Map<string, bytes>  // gas used, compute time, etc.\n}\n```\n\n**Settlement Interface (ECHO Token):**\n\nThe settlement interface would be a smart contract on ECHO's chain:\n\n```solidity\ninterface ISkillRuntimeSettlement {\n    // Submit execution proof, trigger payment\n    function settleExecution(\n        bytes32 executionId,\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof,\n        address payee,\n        uint256 amount\n    ) external returns (bool);\n    \n    // Challenge an execution\n    function challengeExecution(\n        bytes32 executionId,\n        Challenge calldata challenge\n    ) external;\n    \n    // Verify proof on-chain\n    function verifyProof(\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof\n    ) external view returns (bool valid, string memory reason);\n}\n```\n\nLet me write this up in a clear architectural document format, similar to my previous responses.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公问得好。Skill Runtime + TDX 是 Agent 能力资产化的核心基础设施层——让 Skill 执行可被**客观验证**，这是使用权经济从\"信任\"走向\"可计算\"的关键一跳。\n\n让我从头推演这套架构。\n\n---\n\n## Skill Runtime in TDX — 架构推演\n\n### 顶层设计理念\n\n```\n  ECHO Token 结算层 (链上)\n         ↑  证明提交 / 争议仲裁\n  ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n  │   Skill Runtime (TDX TD)    │  ← 可信执行环境\n  │   证明生成 / 执行审计         │\n  ├─────────────────────────────┤\n  │   Agent / Skill 逻辑         │  ← 实际计算\n  └─────────────────────────────┘\n         ↑  请求 / 数据\n    使用方 / 终端用户\n```\n\n核心命题：**Runtime 如何证明\"我诚实地执行了 Skill，并产生了正确的结果\"**？\n\n---\n\n### 一、Attestation 流程\n\nAttestation 是整个体系信任的根。TDX 提供了硬件级远程证明（Remote Attestation）。\n\n#### 1.1 前置注册阶段\n\n```\n[Runtime Operator]                  [ECHO 链]\n       │                                │\n       │ 1. 构建 Runtime 镜像           │\n       │    (Skill Runtime + Agent)     │\n       │ 2. 计算 MRTD (测量值)          │\n       │ 3. 注册 Runtime                │\n       ├───────────────────────────────►│\n       │   registerRuntime(            │\n       │     runtimeId,                │\n       │     mrtdHash,                 │\n       │     runtimeDescriptor         │\n       │   )                           │\n       │◄───────────────────────────────│\n       │   Runtime 注册成功             │\n```\n\nMRTD（Measurement of Initial TD）是 TDX 启动时对初始状态的哈希值——类似 Docker image digest，但由硬件保证不可篡改。\n\n#### 1.2 执行请求时的 Attestation 流程\n\n```\n[使用方]              [Skill Runtime (TDX)]              [Intel PCCS/DCAP]\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 1. 请求执行 Skill       │                                  │\n  ├────────────────────────►│                                  │\n  │    { skillId, input,   │                                  │\n  │      callbackAddr,     │                                  │\n  │      nonce }           │                                  │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 2. (TDX TD 启动)       │                                  │\n  │    Runtime 初始化       │                                  │\n  │    TDX 硬件生成 Quote   │                                  │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │              3. 向 PCCS 请求 TDX Quote ──────────────────►│\n  │                          ◄────────────────────────────────│\n  │                             Quote (硬件签名)               │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 4. 返回 Quote + Nonce  │                                  │\n  │◄────────────────────────┤                                  │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 5. 验证 Quote：         │                                  │\n  │    - 证书链：Intel Root → Intel SGX/TDX → TD Quoting      │\n  │    - MRTD 是否与注册时一致                                 │\n  │    - RTMR 链(运行时度量)                                   │\n  │    - Nonce 是否匹配请求                                    │\n  │                         │                                  │\n  │ 6. 验证通过 → 信任该 TD                                   │\n```\n\n**关键设计点：**\n\n| 要素 | 作用 |\n|------|------|\n| **MRTD** | 证明 Runtime 代码未被篡改 |\n| **RTMR[0-3]** | 证明 Runtime 的状态转换路径正确（如配置、输入加载过程） |\n| **User Data (REPORTDATA)** | 嵌入 session 公钥 + nonce，绑定后续通信 |\n| **Quote 签名链** | Intel 硬件背书，防伪造 |\n\n**Attestation 验证后在当前 session 中建立信任上下文：**\n\n```\nTrustContext {\n  runtimeId: bytes32,\n  publicKey: bytes,       // TD 内部生成的 ephemeral key\n  sessionId: bytes32,\n  attestationTimestamp: u64,\n  mrtdVerified: bool,\n  rtmsVerified: bool\n}\n```\n\n使用方的验证可以在链下（轻客户端）完成，也可以在链上由 ECHO 协议合约完成（gas 较重）。\n\n---\n\n### 二、Execution Proof 结构\n\nExecution Proof 是\"技能使用记录\"的不可伪造证据，包含三部分：**执行前状态 → 执行过程轨迹 → 执行后结果**。\n\n#### 2.1 整体结构\n\n```\nExecutionProof {\n  // === 标识字段 ===\n  version: uint8,              // 协议版本\n  proofType: enum {            // 证明类型\n    UNVERIFIED,                // 无证明（非 TEE 回退模式）\n    TDX_SIMPLE,                // 仅输出哈希\n    TDX_FULL_TRACE             // 完整执行追踪\n  }\n  \n  // === 执行身份 ===\n  runtimeId: bytes32,          // Skill Runtime 的链上注册 ID\n  skillId: bytes32,            // 执行的 Skill 标识\n  sessionId: bytes32,          // 执行 session 标识\n  \n  // === 执行内容 ===\n  inputHash: bytes32,          // keccak256(abi.encode(input))\n  outputHash: bytes32,         // keccak256(abi.encode(output))\n  executionHash: bytes32,      // keccak256(fullExecutionTrace)\n  \n  // === TDX Attestation 层 ===\n  tdQuote: TDXQuote {\n    mrtd: bytes[48],           // 初始度量\n    rtmr: bytes[4][48],        // 四个运行时度量寄存器\n    reportData: bytes[64],     // 绑定的 sessionPubKey + sessionId\n    quoteSignature: bytes,     // Intel 签名的 Quote\n    certChain: bytes           // Intel 证书链\n  },\n  \n  // === 执行元数据 ===\n  timestamp: uint64,\n  gasUsed: uint256,            // 计算资源消耗\n  computeTime: uint64,         // 实际执行时间(ms)\n  \n  // === 可选的第三方验证 ===\n  verifierSignatures: [\n    { verifier: address, sig: bytes }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.2 TDX 内部 Execution Hash 生成流程\n\n```\n                     ┌─────────────┐\n    Skill Input ────►│  TDX Guard  │\n                     │  (不可绕过)  │\n                     └──────┬──────┘\n                            │ 记录 input hash + 时间戳\n                            ▼\n                     ┌─────────────┐\n                     │  Skill VM   │\n                     │  执行过程    │\n                     └──────┬──────┘\n                            │ 每一步操作记录到执行追踪\n                            ▼\n                     ┌─────────────┐\n                     │  TDX Guard  │\n                     │  (不可绕过)  │\n                     └──────┬──────┘\n                            │ 最终：executionHash = H(inputHash || steps[] || outputHash)\n                            │ 写入 REPORTDATA → Quote 中锁定\n                            ▼\n                   ExecutionProof 就绪\n```\n\n**精髓：** TDX Quote 的 REPORTDATA 字段绑定 executionHash，使得 Execution Proof 与硬件 Attestation 成为一体——你无法在不被察觉的情况下篡改执行记录。\n\n#### 2.3 可选的证明压缩\n\n对于高频低值执行，不需要完整证明，可使用 **Merkle 聚合**：\n\n```\nMerkleProofNode {\n  left: bytes32,            // H(prevProof || sessionId)\n  right: bytes32,\n  aggregatedProof: ExecutionProofSummary  // 仅摘要\n}\n```\n\n多条执行记录只需一次 TDX Attestation，后续执行用 Merkle 链链接，大幅降低 gas 成本。这个设计在后续我会展开。\n\n---\n\n### 三、与 ECHO Token 的结算接口设计\n\n这是**使用权经济的支付层**——执行完成并生成 Proof 后，使用方需向 Skill 提供方支付 ECHO Token。\n\n#### 3.1 链上结算合约接口\n\n```solidity\n// ISkillRuntimeSettlement.sol\npragma solidity ^0.8.20;\n\nstruct ExecutionProof {\n    bytes32 runtimeId;\n    bytes32 skillId;\n    bytes32 inputHash;\n    bytes32 outputHash;\n    bytes32 executionHash;\n    bytes  tdQuote;          // TDX Quote (serialized)\n    uint64 timestamp;\n    uint256 gasUsed;\n    address provider;        // Skill 提供者\n    address consumer;        // 使用方\n}\n\nenum DisputeStatus { NONE, CHALLENGED, RESOLVED_PROVIDER, RESOLVED_CONSUMER }\n\ninterface ISkillRuntimeSettlement {\n    \n    /// @notice 提交执行证明并结算\n    /// @param proof 执行证明\n    /// @param amount 结算金额（ECHO Token）\n    /// @return executionId 生成的执行记录 ID\n    function submitAndSettle(\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof,\n        uint256 amount\n    ) external returns (bytes32 executionId);\n    \n    /// @notice 批量结算（多条证明聚合）\n    function batchSettle(\n        ExecutionProof[] calldata proofs,\n        uint256 totalAmount\n    ) external returns (bytes32[] memory executionIds);\n    \n    /// @notice 挑战一个执行结果（质疑证明无效）\n    /// @param executionId 执行记录 ID\n    /// @param challengeData 挑战依据（如 re-execution 结果）\n    function challenge(\n        bytes32 executionId,\n        bytes calldata challengeData\n    ) external;\n    \n    /// @notice 证明验证（链上验证 TDX Quote）\n    /// @param proof 执行证明\n    /// @return valid 是否有效\n    /// @return reason 无效原因\n    function verifyProof(\n        ExecutionProof calldata proof\n    ) external view returns (bool valid, string memory reason);\n    \n    /// @notice 查询执行记录\n    function getExecutionRecord(\n        bytes32 executionId\n    ) external view returns (\n        ExecutionProof memory proof,\n        DisputeStatus status,\n        uint256 settledAmount,\n        uint256 lockedAmount\n    );\n    \n    /// @notice 注册 Runtime（运营商使用）\n    function registerRuntime(\n        bytes32 runtimeId,\n        bytes memory mrtdHash,\n        bytes memory descriptor\n    ) external;\n}\n```\n\n#### 3.2 结算流程\n\n```\n使用方                                 Skill Runtime (TDX)                      ECHO 链\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │  1. 发起执行请求                          │                                    │\n  ├─────────────────────────────────────────►│                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │              2. TDX Attestation          │                                    │\n  │                  ◄─── Quote ──►          │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │          3. 验证 Quote ✓                 │                                    │\n  │   (使用方确认环境可信)                     │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │              4. 执行 Skill               │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │  5. 返回 Output + ExecutionProof         │                                    │\n  │◄─────────────────────────────────────────┤                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │  6. 验证 Output 与 proof.outputHash      │                                    │\n  │     一致 → 确认执行正确                    │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │              7. approve(结算合约, amount)  │                                   │\n  │  ├───────────────────────────────────────►│                                    │\n  │  │ (使用方预授权 ECHO Token)               │                                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │                                          │  8. submitAndSettle(proof, amount) │\n  │                                          ├──────────────────────────────────►│\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │                                          │               9. 验证 proof        │\n  │                                          │              transferFrom(使用方)   │\n  │                                          │              transfer(提供商)        │\n  │                                          │◄──────────────────────────────────│\n  │                                          │     executionId                    │\n  │                                          │                                    │\n  │              10. 收到完成确认              │                                    │\n```\n\n#### 3.3 争议仲裁机制\n\n争议场景：使用方声称执行结果不对，拒绝付款。\n\n```\n[争议发生]\n     │\n     ├─ 1. 使用方调用 challenge(executionId, reason)\n     │\n     ├─ 2. 冻结结算金额至争议锁定池\n     │\n     ├─ 3. 仲裁阶段（二选一）：\n     │\n     │   A. 链上重执行（轻量级 Skill）\n     │      - 合约内置验证器，传入 input + runtimeId\n     │      - 重新计算 outputHash，与 proof 比对\n     │      - 一致 → 提供商胜，解冻并支付\n     │      - 不一致 → 使用方胜，退款\n     │\n     │   B. 委托仲裁（重量级 Skill）\n     │      - 随机选取 3 个独立验证节点\n     │      - 每个节点在 TDX 中重新执行\n     │      - 多数决 → 败诉方额外支付仲裁费用\n     │\n     ├─ 4. 执行罚则：\n     │      - 证明伪造：提供商 slash 质押的 ECHO Token\n     │      - 恶意挑战：使用方扣除保证金\n     │\n     └─ 5. 状态更新至 Resolved\n```\n\n#### 3.4 定价模型（结算接口的核心参数）\n\n```solidity\n// 定价结构\nstruct PricingModel {\n    address token;             // ECHO Token 地址\n    uint256 baseFee;          // 基础执行费用\n    uint256 perGasFee;        // 每单位 Gas 费用\n    uint256 perByteFee;       // 每字节输入数据费用\n    uint256 attestationFee;   // Attestation 附加费（TDX 的开销）\n    uint64  minExecutionTime; // 最小保证时间（防女巫）\n    uint64  maxExecutionTime; // 超时限制\n}\n```\n\nSkill 提供商在注册时设定定价参数，使用方在执行前可查询总费用：\n\n```\ntotalFee = baseFee + (gasUsed * perGasFee) + (inputSize * perByteFee) + attestationFee\n```\n\n---\n\n### 四、三个核心机制的交互关系（关键图）\n\n```\n                     ┌──────────────────────┐\n                     │      使用方           │\n                     │  (支付 ECHO Token)     │\n                     └──────┬───────┬───────┘\n                            │       │\n                Attestation │       │ 验证 output\n                 验证信任    │       │ 提交 proof\n                            │       │\n                     ┌──────▼───────▼───────┐\n                     │    Skill Runtime     │\n                     │    (TDX TD)          │\n                     │                      │\n                     │  ┌────────────────┐  │\n                     │  │ TDX Guard      │  │\n                     │  │ input → trace  │  │\n                     │  │ → output hash  │  │\n                     │  │ → Quote 锁定    │  │\n                     │  └───────┬────────┘  │\n                     │          │            │\n                     │  ┌───────▼────────┐  │\n                     │  │ Skill VM       │  │\n                     │  │ (实际计算)      │  │\n                     │  └────────────────┘  │\n                     └──────────────────────┘\n                              │\n                     ExecutionProof\n                              │\n                     ┌───────▼────────┐\n                     │   ECHO 链      │\n                     │  结算合约       │\n                     │  争议仲裁合约    │\n                     │  Runtime 注册器 │\n                     └────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### 五、推演结论与风险提示\n\n#### 架构亮点\n1. **信任最小化**：TDX Attestation 代替了中心化的\"我相信你执行了\"，变为\"硬件证明你执行了\"\n2. **证明即支付**：ExecutionProof 既是对执行的审计记录，也是触发结算的唯一凭证\n3. **争议可仲裁**：链上验证或委托重执行，避免了\"他说他算了对，我说他算错了\"的死锁\n\n#### ⚠️ 需要注意的风险\n\n| 风险 | 影响 | 对冲方案 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| TDX 侧信道攻击 | 执行过程被观测，数据泄露 | 不处理私钥等极敏感数据；或结合同态加密 |\n| Intel 证书撤销 | 已签发的 Quote 失效 | 设置 Attestation 有效期，定期轮换 |\n| Quote gas 成本高 | TDX Quote 校验在链上很贵 | 使用 ZK 压缩 Quote 验证，或链下验证 + 链上仅存 hash |\n| 执行结果二义性 | 非确定性执行导致 re-execution 结果不同 | 强制运行时确定性执行（锁定随机数种子、时间戳等） |\n\n#### 优先推进路径\n\n```\nPhase 1: TDX Quote 验证库\n  - 实现 TDX Quote 的链上/链下验证\n  - 建立 Runtime 注册流程\n\nPhase 2: Execution Proof 标准\n  - 确定 proof 数据结构 & 序列化格式\n  - TDX Guard（不可绕过层）的实现\n\nPhase 3: ECHO 结算合约\n  - submitAndSettle + challenge 核心接口\n  - 定价模型合约\n\nPhase 4: 压缩与聚合\n  - Merkle 聚合证明\n  - ZK 压缩 Quote 验证（降 gas）\n```\n\n---\n\n主公，这套架构草图从**信任**（Attestation）→ **记录**（ExecutionProof）→ **价值**（ECHO Token 结算）形成了一条完整闭环。如需深入某个层——比如 TDX Guard 的详细设计、链上 Quote 验证的具体实现、或者定价模型的数学公式——我随时展开。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779109187008,"responseId":"925a4c85759443379df8634e1ae4dbb7"}}
